__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
logs/*
!logs/README.md
!logs/retained/
!logs/retained/README.md
# Audit-lane runner cache: SHA-pinned, version-controlled. See
# docs/audit/RUNNER_CACHE_POLICY.md.
!logs/runner-cache/
!logs/runner-cache/**
# In-progress live logs are transient (replaced by canonical cache on
# completion); do NOT commit them.
logs/runner-cache/.in-progress/
.claude/worktrees/

# Python virtual environments (per-developer, per-worktree).
# See docs/repo/PYTHON_VENV_SETUP.md for setup instructions.
.venv/
venv/
env/

.claude/science/physics-loops/**/last_codex_message.md
.claude/science/physics-loops/**/supervisor.lock
.claude/science/physics-loops/**/supervisor.log
.claude/science/physics-loops/**/supervisor_status.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Long-running plaquette MC checkpoints are large resume artifacts; commit the
# JSON summaries and per-stream outputs, not the active lattice checkpoints.
outputs/plaquette_mc_grade4_2026_06_11/checkpoints/

# Pipeline-generated audit caches (sharded ledger under docs/audit/data/ledger/
# is the tracked source of truth; these are materialized by
# docs/audit/scripts/ledger_io.py and run_pipeline.sh)
docs/audit/data/audit_ledger.json
docs/audit/data/ledger_cache_manifest.json
docs/audit/data/citation_graph.json
docs/audit/data/audit_queue.json
# Shadow-mode dispatch emitters (dispatch-retarget design note 2026-07-16):
# generated every pipeline pass; the tracked authority is
# publication_lane_manifest.json.
docs/audit/data/publication_gap.json
docs/audit/data/audit_publication_lane.json
docs/audit/data/runner_classification.json
docs/audit/data/static_pipeline_checkpoint.json
docs/audit/AUDIT_LEDGER.md
